# Binaries for programs and plugins
*.exe
*.exe~
*.dll
*.so
*.dylib
*.log
*.msi
*.log
*.bat
# Test binary, built with `go test -c`
*.test

# Output of the go coverage tool, specifically when used with LiteIDE
*.out

# Dependency directories (remove the comment below to include it)
vendor/
.idea/
build/
log/
target/
# Config yaml /json etc.
configdevx.yaml
config.yaml
log.*
testdata/

# 前端(bus/payment-web)依赖与构建中间产物
node_modules/
payment-web/.vite/
payment-web/*.tsbuildinfo
payment-web/npm-debug.log*
payment-web/yarn-error.log*
payment-web/.npm/

# 前端**打包产物**(bus/payment-web 构建出来的,落在 payment/platform/web/dist)
#
# 这份产物不进库:Go 端 //go:embed 会在编译时把它打进二进制,
# 所以提交它等于把同一份 JS 存两遍。
# 构建:cd bus/payment-web && npm run build(或 make build-frontend)。
# 只留 .gitkeep —— 目录不在,//go:embed 会直接编译失败。
payment/platform/web/dist/assets/
payment/platform/web/dist/index.html

# 支付平台运行时产物(SQLite 库、主密钥文件、微信平台证书缓存)
payment-data/
certs/
*.pem
*.key
*.crt
# 测试用固定证书/密钥属于源码,例外放行
!payment/**/testdata/*.pem
!payment/**/testdata/*.crt
!payment/**/testdata/*.key

# 临时联调脚本(里面有真实邮箱账号 / 授权码,一律不入库)
tmp_*.go
tmp_*

# go mod file